# Villainous Hideout: the {U} it makes is for Villain spells and abilities of Villain sources only (CR 106.6). Brainstorm, a
# one-mana blue instant that is no Villain, is not offered with it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Villainous Hideout
Brainstorm
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Villainous Hideout.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Villainous Hideout.Activate(Ability: Add one mana of any color; Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U} (VillainSpellsOrAbilities)
! Bot1.Hand.Brainstorm.Cast(Mana: short)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {U} (VillainSpellsOrAbilities)
